---
// src/pages/about.astro
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
        title="About iPostDeals"
        description="iPostDeals is a deal discovery site that finds and shares the best online discounts across tech, gadgets, and more."
>
  <section class="page">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h1>About iPostDeals</h1>

      <h2>What We Do</h2>
      <p>
        iPostDeals tracks computer hardware deals — NAS and enterprise drives,
        graphics cards, processors, memory, and SSDs. When a listing looks
        genuinely worth your attention, we post it with a direct link to the
        source and the price we observed.
      </p>

      <h2>How It Works</h2>
      <p>
        An automated tool monitors deal feeds and marketplace listings —
        currently Slickdeals, eBay, and Ben's Bargains — and compares
        candidates against current market pricing for the same class of
        product. Anything that clears our threshold is queued for review.
      </p>
      <p>
        Nothing is published automatically. Every listing on this site was
        looked at by a person before it went up.
      </p>

      <h2>What We Don't Claim</h2>
      <p>
        The price on each card is what we observed at the time shown. Prices
        and stock change without notice, and we are not the seller. We don't
        claim a price is the lowest ever — only what our own tracking has seen,
        over the period we have been tracking it. Where we can't support a
        comparison with data, we don't make one.
      </p>

      <h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        When a link earns us a commission it is marked as sponsored, and it
        costs you nothing extra. We do not currently have any affiliate
        relationships in place, so no link on this site earns us anything
        today. If that changes, this page will say so.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
      padding: 3rem 0 4rem;
  }

  h1 {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  h2 {
      margin-top: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
